James sought assistance with rendering two shapefiles in Leaflet, where one shapefile's tooltips failed to render correctly due to an issue with `spdf[, namecol.spdf, drop=T]`. After examining potential reasons—including encoding, special characters, and null values—specific special characters were identified: "Near \xc0ird" and "Near Port M\xf2r". Arachne proposed replacing these characters with HTML entities (`&Agrave;` for "À" and `&ograve;` for "ò"). A function was suggested to replace special characters before constructing tooltip text, ensuring proper rendering and enhancing the Leaflet visualization.
